# 1️⃣1️⃣ PCA PIPELINE ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐

This is worth understanding extremely well.

```text
Raw Dataset
     ↓
Standardize Features
     ↓
Calculate Covariance Matrix
     ↓
Calculate Eigenvalues
     ↓
Calculate Eigenvectors
     ↓
Sort by Eigenvalues
     ↓
Select Top Components
     ↓
Project Data
     ↓
Reduced Dataset
```

That's PCA.

