# 1️⃣2️⃣ WHY STANDARDIZE BEFORE PCA?

Suppose:

```text
Age:
20–60

Salary:
20,000–2,00,000
```

Salary has much larger numerical scale.

Without scaling, salary could dominate the variance calculation.

So commonly:

```text
Original data
      ↓
StandardScaler
      ↓
PCA
```

Remember:

> PCA is variance-based, so feature scale can strongly affect it.

